# Check out text files with LF on every platform. Release scripts pin the SHA-256 of
# licence notices (docs/licenses/), and Rust embeds pack files with include_str!, so a
# Windows checkout must not turn them into CRLF (decision 0077).
* text=auto eol=lf
# Model graphs are binary: never normalised (the recogniser is committed, decision 0172).
*.onnx binary
